. Find recipes and ingredients to bake pies, and help quirky castaway residents off the island. Discover the mystery of what's keeping them there. New abilities will help you access more and more whimsical areas!\n\nYou are Erma, retired, relaxing by the beach in your quiet retirement island paradise when you see a plane falling out of the sky. There starts your adventure, following clues as to where the plane landed (certainly not in one piece) and help out!", "summary": "Explore a whimsical island to find\u2026 pie recipes?! Bake them by gathering or growing ingredients, which may be the key to helping out your new found quirky friends leave the island! In this wholesome 3D platformer collectathon, you can enjoy discovering the world freely at your own pace.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/portabellows", "videos": [{"id": 152603, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "FrfWVyKejTU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FrfWVyKejTU", "title": "Portabellows - Gameplay Teaser", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/FrfWVyKejTU/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 162370, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "gSkDr9smi4c", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gSkDr9smi4c", "title": "Portabellows - Official Gameplay Trailer | Game Devs of Color Expo 2025", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/gSkDr9smi4c/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 186320, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "_V1m4PTdZcM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_V1m4PTdZcM", "title": "Portabellows - Official Demo Launch Trailer | Women-Led Games x SGF 2026", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_V1m4PTdZcM/fhddefault.jpg"}]}